          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We absolutely loved hearing your thoughts on your all-time favorite Misha & Puff prints on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/anna_mishaandpuff\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/anna_mishaandpuff\">Anna’s Instagram</a> — so we’re bringing some of them back, just for you!</p><p>This Made-to-Order (MTO) collection features a selection of the most beloved and requested archival prints — treasures from across the years — available in Baby, Child, and Adult styles.</p><p>All orders are expected to ship in mid-Fall 2025. This MTO will close on Tuesday, May 27, at 11:59 PM ET.</p>",
