        "text_jhkXDN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>WHAT TO EXPECT</h3><p>Our Made-to-Order program is an initiative that we are very proud of — and at the heart of why we do what we do. This program introduces the ability to custom shop some of your favorite Misha & Puff styles in a limited small-batch capsule outside of our seasonal collections, while delivering on our promise to support our vendors and knitting partners year-round.<br/><br/>Every piece we create blends craftsmanship, heritage, and quality and each of our treasured partners provides unique contributions that amplify our appreciation of time-honored processes. Supporting handmade means supporting the local communities behind these crafts. Learn more about our <a href=\"/pages/values\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Values\">sustainability efforts</a> and our incredible <a href=\"/pages/people\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"People\">artisanal partners</a>.</p>",
            "line_height": 22
          }
        }
      },
